briefing =
    FACTUAL CUTOFF: 11 AUGUST 2026

    A coastal aid and fisheries corridor must remain operational while fixed infrastructure and dispersed forces face sustained pressure.

    Your construction yard, refinery, war factory, radar, and airfield are online. Protect Port Control, the fisheries depot, and the coastal clinic; escort relief supplies to the inland distribution point; disperse your mobile force before the surveillance sweep; then keep the return route open for the final evacuation convoy.

    The background is source-dated. Forces, timing, positions, and outcomes are fictional gameplay abstractions.

protect-lifeline-infrastructure = Keep Port Control, the fisheries depot, and the coastal clinic operational.
deliver-relief-supplies = Escort relief supplies to the inland distribution point.
disperse-mobile-forces = Move the marked mobile force outside the port surveillance zone before the sweep.
preserve-evacuation-route = Preserve the route until the final evacuation convoy reaches the port.

